WEBVTT

41:32.141 --> 41:34.060
you didn't know where to put it?

41:35.311 --> 41:37.480
(LAUGHING)

41:39.899 --> 41:41.901
Enjoying yourselves?

41:43.944 --> 41:45.863
You look cold, boys.

41:45.988 --> 41:48.866
- (DOOR CREAKS)
- It is a bit nippy.

41:48.991 --> 41:51.827
A bit nippy, yeah, by the fire,

41:51.952 --> 41:53.871
indoors.

41:53.996 --> 41:55.706
It's still summer.

41:56.665 --> 41:59.585
Do you boys even remember
the last winter?
